               Roxana",
  journal   = "NPJ Digit. Med.",
  publisher = "Springer Science and Business Media LLC",
  volume    =  8,
  number    =  1,
  pages     =  149,
  abstract  = "Red teaming, the practice of adversarially exposing unexpected or
